    "Only the startup scan change is production code. Endpoint and worker paths remain experimental.",
    "Fingerprint mode checks all live injection values, voltage bits, matrix identity/revision, membership, observers, time, norm and tolerance.",
    "Closed mode additionally requires an explicit owner guarantee for every external input, setpoint, fixed-current, load and device state mutation between CORRECTOR and INITIAL.",
